  "description": "Vampire Vape Pinkman Watermelon E-Liquid combines the legendary Pinkman profile with a fresh fruit twist. This blend is built on the iconic Pinkman foundation of sweet Red Berries, bringing the familiar taste of Strawberry and Raspberry together with subtle, zesty Citrus undertones. To this established classic, Vampire Vape layers the crisp, clean taste of Watermelon. The Watermelon adds a lighter, refreshing dimension to the mix, softening the sharp citrus hints while enhancing the overall fruitiness. It creates a balanced profile that offers a sweet, juicy inhale with a clean finish. This 10ml freebase e-liquid is available in a versatile range of nicotine strengths, including 0mg, 3mg, 6mg, 12mg, and 18mg. Please note that Vampire Vape adjusts the VG/PG ratio depending on the nicotine strength selected: 3mg is mixed at 50VG/50PG, making it ideal for most starter kits and pod vape kits. 0mg, 6mg, 12mg, and 18mg are mixed at 40VG/60PG, which provides a sharper throat hit and is best suited for MTL (Mouth-to-Lung) starter kits and lower-powered devices.",
